  "title": "Classic Chicken Tetrazzini",
  "description": "This classic chicken tetrazzini recipe is a feast! It pairs mushrooms with a Swiss cheese cream sauce to blanket the pasta, chicken, and bell peppers.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
